<title>USA: TRO Q3 benefits from Plato courseware.</title>
<headline>TRO Q3 benefits from Plato courseware.</headline>
<dateline>HOFFMAN ESTATES, Ill. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>TRO Learning Inc, reporting improved July 31 third-quarter results, said Plato Education courseware license and support revenues rose 47 percent in the period.</p>
<p>For the quarter, earnings rose to $0.11 per share from $0.09. Revenues advanced to $11.4 million from $8.9 million a year ago.</p>
<p>&quot;The trend of education and business addressing skills deficiencies through the ue of computer-based education and training continues to be very positive,&quot; said chairman William Roach in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
